- Added Javadoc comments for the new controller method and repository method

Tests:
- Verified successful delete redirects to /owners/find with a flash success message
- Verified the correct Owner (with pets) is passed to delete()
- Verified deleting a non-existent owner throws/returns an error, and delete() is never called
- Verified GET on the delete endpoint is rejected (405)

